        "## 🧰 Part 1: Predefined Libraries & String Manipulation\n",
        "\n",
        "A **Library** is like a toolbox. If a useful tool already exists, you don't need to build it from zero!\n",
        "\n",
        "### Common String Cleaning Tasks:\n",
        "* `strip()`: Removes extra leading and trailing spaces.\n",
        "* `title()`: Capitalizes the first letter of each word (proper name formatting).\n",
        "* `upper()`: Converts all characters to UPPERCASE.\n",
        "* `lower()`: Converts all characters to lowercase.\n",
        "* `len()`: Counts total characters (including spaces).\n",
        "* `find(substr)`: Locates the starting position of a substring.\n",
        "* `isdigit()` / `isalpha()`: Checks if text consists strictly of numbers or letters.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
